to time on fan-edits of NSFW art (read: porn) on 4chan, primarily the /d/ board. Linking would probably be frowned upon, but for the morbidly curious, it has to do with Code Geass and ganguro, and someone sported a bane glyph tattoo, or something close to it. Other motifs that look kind of like Bastet ones also show up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T16:41:08-07:00","id":955981,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/448627-anyone-here-have-a-wod-tattoo?p=955317#post955317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's the strangest thing, but I've seen some Werewolf glyphs show up from time to time on fan-edits of NSFW art (read: porn) on 4chan, primarily the /d/ board. Linking would probably be frowned upon, but for the morbidly curious, it has to do with Code Geass and ganguro, and someone sported a bane glyph tattoo, or something close to it. Other motifs that look kind of like Bastet ones also show up.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> If you can, any chance you could PM me a link? I'd love to see them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T17:58:25-07:00","id":956035,"title":"","content":"Out of 11 tats I have 10 WoD<br /> Stargazers tribal glyph<br /> Shadow Lord glyph<br /> Grandfather Thunder glyph<br /> Lodge of the Savior symbol<br /> Storm Lords glyph<br /> Werewolf from the Lore of the Forsaken book<br /> Bubasti and Pumonca character designs from the Bastet breed book<br /> Ministry of Scarecrows<br /> Lucifuge<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T18:06:37-07:00","id":956041,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowlost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/448627-anyone-here-have-a-wod-tattoo?p=956035#post956035\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Out of 11 tats I have 10 WoD<br /> Stargazers tribal glyph<br /> Shadow Lord glyph<br /> Grandfather Thunder glyph<br /> Lodge of the Savior symbol<br /> Storm Lords glyph<br /> Werewolf from the Lore of the Forsaken book<br /> Bubasti and Pumonca character designs from the Bastet breed book<br /> Ministry of Scarecrows<br /> Lucifuge</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Love for both WoD and ChroD. Nice!<br /> <br /> And I always thought the Lucifuge symbol was pretty cool. Same with the the Shadow Lords, despite my distaste for them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-22T22:04:37-07:00","id":956154,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/448627-anyone-here-have-a-wod-tattoo?p=955317#post955317\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's the strangest thing, but I've seen some Werewolf glyphs show up from time to time on fan-edits of NSFW art (read: porn) on 4chan, primarily the /d/ board. Linking would probably be frowned upon, but for the morbidly curious, it has to do with Code Geass and ganguro, and someone sported a bane glyph tattoo, or something close to it. Other motifs that look kind of like Bastet ones also show up.</div> </div> </div> </div>I remember watching one of the making of porn specials on Showtime/HBO whatever and one of the guys had all 9 Bastet tribe glyphs on one leg, the 17 garou tribes (Including lost tribes and BSD) on his other. A huge Tzimisce on his back and the Cult of Ecstacy on his chest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1250-shadowlost","name":"Shadowlost","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"155"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T02:15:01-07:00","id":957478,"title":"","content":"Got a little Camarilla ankh on my chest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-25T13:10:09-07:00","id":957795,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowlost</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/448627-anyone-here-have-a-wod-tattoo?p=956154#post956154\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I remember watching one of the making of porn specials on Showtime/HBO whatever and one of the guys had all 9 Bastet tribe glyphs on one leg, the 17 garou tribes (Including lost tribes and BSD) on his other. A huge Tzimisce on his back and the Cult of Ecstacy on his chest.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder if it was an influence on that happenstance. Kind of difficult to tell, really.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-27T16:00:27-07:00","id":958933,"title":"","content":"I once met a woman at GenCon (back when it was in Wisconsin) who had a Black Fury symbol on her upper arm. While this wasn't a WOD-based one, but about 15 years ago I worked at a fast food place (Culvers') and there was this old man who had a human eye tattooed on his forehead and it made his look just like a Salubri. (Except the pupil was shaped like a heart.) And was soooo tempted to say, &quot;I guess the Tremere didn't kill you all off, afterall&quot;, to him as I delivered him and his family their food.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my DriveThruRPG books at: <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?author=Carrie%20Kube\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse....=Carrie%20Kube</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1834-yaoi-huntress-earth","name":"Yaoi Huntress Earth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1834_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"535"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T12:43:34-07:00","id":974604,"title":"","content":"Had a few more done recently:<br /> <br /> 1. Vampire the Requiem Unaligned Ankh on my bicep. Not really a fan of Requiem, but I love the ankh.<br /> 2. Avalon Inc. logo from Werewolf the Apocalypse but with my last name instead of &quot;Avalon.&quot;<br /> 3. Skull from Book of Nod. Not the circle of skulls, however. Just one of them.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-22T13:09:04-07:00","id":974626,"title":"","content":"A friend of mine is owned by the Camarilla Assamites, according to his tats.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T10:48:43-07:00","id":975125,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Yaoi Huntress Earth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/448627-anyone-here-have-a-wod-tattoo?p=958933#post958933\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I once met a woman at GenCon (back when it was in Wisconsin) who had a Black Fury symbol on her upper arm. While this wasn't a WOD-based one, but about 15 years ago I worked at a fast food place (Culvers') and there was this old man who had a human eye tattooed on his forehead and it made his look just like a Salubri. (Except the pupil was shaped like a heart.) And was soooo tempted to say, &quot;I guess the Tremere didn't kill you all off, afterall&quot;, to him as I delivered him and his family their food.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know, speaking of the Black Furies glyph, and WW motifs used in art, have you ever looked at the outline of Anita's hair in Darkstalkers? It's hilariously similar, <a href=\"https://youtu.be/nyjySUN5UXI?t=89\" target=\"_blank\">at least in the OVA</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-09-23T21:13:29-07:00","id":975364,"title":"","content":"Personally, i been thinking (Which is dangerous) to ink my whole left arm (up to my hand) with each of the mage spheres starting with forces and finishing in my hand with Prime.<br /> also, i been thinking about doing the Nuwisha glyph on my shoulder pads or MDG from hunter on my right fore arm. but dunno, my work doenst allow me to show tattos","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forum's Official's Joker and Trickster. Pardon my bad english, aint my first language (I Speak Spanish).<br /> ST: DtF, HtR, WtO, MtA<br /> Signature Chars: Crowley (hakalu), Joe The Nuwisha (WtA)<br /> Changelings: be afraid of the Technocracian High Five of Doom","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1754-crowley","name":"Crowley","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1754_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1639"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-17T08:44:53-08:00","id":1168381,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/448627-anyone-here-have-a-wod-tattoo#post448627\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm hoping I'm not the only person crazy enough to be rocking some World of Darkness ink.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://40.media.tumblr.com/8bf156690bbab8dd26f416e1cc05cff1/tumblr_nl2z6ylQ5r1r21rsxo1_500.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>I once was thinking about inking entire history of my favourite character using Garou glyphs. Problem is: I'm a ST and it's hard to pick up one <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />. Plus I've got a discourse with my friend about using glyphs as tattoos. He claimed that by doing so you expose your character to your enemies. It's only a matter of time to be discovered by p. ex. BSD. So he started to conceal glyphs in larger patterns (like glyph meaning Klaive put into the heart tattoo). Unfortunately he died before he could finish his work. But I'm still hope that I could finish his work or maybe use some of his idea.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Warrior of the Rainbow<br /> Saint among the sinners<br /> Pure among the dirt<br /> Loser among winners","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13141-nail-eater","name":"Nail Eater","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}